DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, June 27\, 2026 at 3:30 pm\n\nLocation: Academy Muse
 um of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 1h 55m\n\n1957 | 115 min | USA | Technic
 olor | English | Not Rated | 35mm \nDIRECTED BY: Laurence Olivier \nWRIT
 TEN BY: Terence Rattigan \nWITH: Marilyn Monroe\, Laurence Olivier\, Sybi
 l Thorndike\, Richard Wattis\n\nType: Screenings\n\nThe Prince and the Sho
 wgirl in 35mmIn this sole collaboration between Warner Bros. and Marilyn M
 onroe Productions\, Monroe plays Elsie Marina\, a witty American showgirl 
 who gets noticed by the eccentric Prince Regent Charles (Laurence Olivier)
 . Set in Edwardian London and directed by Olivier\, the film was a famousl
 y troubled production\, with tension between co-stars and cinematographer 
 Jack Cardiff. The film was shot at Pinewood Studios outside London\; Monro
 e’s difficulties on and off set were adapted into Simon Curtis’s ficti
 onal My Week with Marilyn (2011)\, with Michelle Williams starring as Monr
 oe.
