DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, June 27\, 2026 at 4 pm\n\nLocation: Shirley Temple 
 Education Studio\n\nRuntime: 1h\n\nCost: Free with general admission\n\nTy
 pe: Conversations\n\nFilm composer\, music producer and Academy Governor R
 ichard Gibbs shares the highlights of his illustrious career. \nThe compos
 er of such feature films as Say Anything (1989)\, Dr. Dolittle (1998)\, 10
  Things I Hate About You (1999) and Queen of the Damned (2002) takes us be
 hind the scenes of his musical journey.
