BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Prestige in 35mm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260810T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260810T223000
DTSTAMP:20260611T093549Z
UID:019dd58c-400e-aae7-d42b-8937636a5c73@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, August 10\, 2026 at 7:30 pm\n\nLocation: Academy Muse
 um of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 2h 10m\n\n2006 | 130 min. | USA | Color 
 | Scope | English | Rated PG-13 | 35mm\nDIRECTED BY: Christopher Nolan\nWR
 ITTEN BY: Jonathan Nolan\, Christopher Nolan\nWITH: Hugh Jackman\, Christi
 an Bale\, Michael Caine\, Scarlett Johansson\nPrint courtesy of the Academ
 y Film Archive.\n\nType: Screenings\n\nTwo illusionists compete at the tur
 n of the 20th century to create history’s greatest magic trick in this t
 ime-fracturing thriller from director/co-writer Christopher Nolan. Based o
 n the 1995 novel by Christopher Priest\, the film earned Oscar nominations
  for its cinematography (Wally Pfister) and art direction (Nathan Crowley\
 , Julie Ochipinti)\, which cleverly used surviving Los Angeles picture pal
 aces as key locations. The stellar cast includes Hugh Jackman and Christia
 n Bale as the rivals\, Michael Caine as their mentor\, Scarlett Johansson 
 and Rebecca Hall as the women in their lives\, and a memorable cameo from 
 David Bowie as the inventor Nikola Tesla.
LOCATION:Academy Museum of Motion Pictures
URL:https://www.academymuseum.org/en/programs/detail/the-prestige-019dd58c
 -400e-aae7-d42b-8937636a5c73
END:VEVENT
