 useum of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 1h 59m\n\n2004 | 119 min. | Japan | C
 olor | Japanese with English subtitles | Rated PG | DCP\nDIRECTED/WRITTEN 
 BY: Hayao Miyazaki \nWITH: Chieko Baisho\, Takuya Kimura\, Akihiro Miwa\,
