 s’s fantasy novel of the same name\, the Oscar-nominated Howl’s Moving
  Castle is a pitch-perfect fairy tale about aging and war\, set in a dazzl
 ing steampunk world. When young hatmaker Sophie is transformed into a 90-y
 ear-old woman by the vengeful Witch of the Waste\, she seeks to break the 
 curse with the help of the enigmatic wizard Howl\, the fire demon Calcifer
