DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260824T150000
DTSTAMP:20260611T093549Z
UID:019dd521-7b44-c524-f75d-3935ed4b9d41@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Monday\, August 24\, 2026 at 2:30 pm\n\nLocation: Academy Muse
 um of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 1h 34m\n\n2010 | 94 min. | Japan | Color
  | Japanese with English subtitles| Rated G | DCP \nDIRECTED BY: Hiromasa 
 Yonebayashi \nWRITTEN BY: Hayao Miyazaki\, Keiko Niwa \nWITH: Mirai Shid
 a\, Ryunosuke Kamiki\, Tatsuya Fujiwara\, Tomokazu Miura\n\nType: Screenin
 gs\n\nDebut director Hiromasa Yonebayashi (When Marnie Was There\, 2014) a
 nd Studio Ghibli teamed up for this film version of Mary Norton’s 1952 c
 hildren’s classic The Borrowers\, full of gorgeous imagery of the natura
 l world. Arrietty is the daughter of a family of Borrowers—miniature peo
 ple secretly living in an occupied house—who risk their home when she be
 friends a human boy.
LOCATION:Academy Museum of Motion Pictures
URL:https://www.academymuseum.org/en/programs/detail/the-secret-world-of-a
 rrietty-019dd521-7b44-c524-f75d-3935ed4b9d41
